## User preferences

- when WMS work is a minor bug, simple export, targeted database data change, or quick hotfix, the owner recorded: «эту цепочку и связанные навыки не запускать» -> work directly with checks proportionate to risk; ask whether the full process is needed only when task scale is genuinely unclear. [Task 2] [ad-hoc note]
- the AVB «Вывод из оборота» investigation is specifically to proceed without an analyst. [Task 2] [ad-hoc note]
- during the Avpak Ozon-link investigation, the user asked to shorten the process and get a short answer on the exact product -> start with targeted read-only records/rules rather than broad process diagnosis. [Task 1] [skysight memory]

## Reusable knowledge

- A failed QR/label print can leave the first-scan auto-print reservation and packed marker behind: an order may look free in UI but reject a repeat scan, or look processed without proof that a label physically emerged. For the observed two supplies, remaining reservations were cleared with audit, then `select_order_for_product_scan` was exercised in rollback-only nested transactions; warehouse UI readback was not recorded. [Task 1] [skysight memory]
- Treat the observed FBS print reports as open until operator paper proof exists: PR #319/`86a8cfb0` and WMS-517 staging `424efa00` were reported deployed, but physical printing and later disabled/extra-empty-label reports were not fully resolved in this evidence. [Task 1] [skysight memory]
- Keep the task board lean: the observed WMS Trello baseline was «Задачи», «В работе», «Готово» after old priority lists were archived; no final Telegram intake announcement was confirmed. [Task 1] [skysight memory]

## Failures and how to do differently

- Do not interpret a completed local FBS supply or a UI row as proof of WB handoff or physical warehouse completion. The user challenged that conclusion while work was still ongoing; reopen the exact operational state and evidence chain. [Task 1] [skysight memory]
- Do not report a marketplace link or KIZ restoration as complete from an assistant update alone. The observed Avpak Ozon-link UI refresh and FBO linkage/data repair were not captured. [Task 1] [skysight memory]

